        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16fc6d671efa36ae7c691f23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有送给你的礼物啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f46ad879cf48536790e63e535f2218b336e1fabb83c6d9a5a3d4021f721047ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe27b90c4e31e13679c25f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你完成了什么任务啊。\r\n应该有什么奖励，去看一眼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ceb9ded3c732eee1d6b149b116a761701729ceb83be674f87ec1ac33844f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85f4b07fb4728e226e80b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像要开始了……\n不过我不大清楚就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08cba763022a8df32b70a67495494162cae185f9bd1b04df58d887ba44e485e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8f31f8059a3ae64f938c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中啊……\n我就说怎么这么吵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "677805c85417e76397bb9db3fee4713aa8aced68f295cb6cf511d8f2eae0f4eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:222281a9c960801081357749",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能接受……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a12b41fcf41b1713a34f38f8408503fde90d7d7edd3909b5fb093880786430",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:640673dcbe99ee2a95fd8922",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级好像提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea365334666d0396fab8a6b8c406f746097cb56b90b41ea6c4a5611c581e6b3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84059531cf1eb272bc5711e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゴツめのアウターって便利だよ。\r\n着とけば下は適当でも\r\nまぁまぁキマるし。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c53bc6b9ea77147fd2d7aff5ed2a60df9e240fdecc2c777efacedd727d77d35a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2baaef8008dbdc76ebf0be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このジーンズ…初めてはいたとき、\r\nクリークさんに『転んじゃったん\r\nですか～？』って心配されてさ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f9c610e746d37faccdeee4c25a6d51e64c7aa9ac26b3d3b98c86170c78c5b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8789d5ddf3bd0eb89627e38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチの学園の美化委員ってホント\r\n真面目だよね。…何。別に、花壇\r\n見ればそれくらいわかるじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "473abd3611a759a2b1c1070fedcb2232098aa768fb80a14da631c61b177ed699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efad1d72a40157878931a820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85c443a1511df19c503a802885da893ff8129bfe4d48c9087b4a1feb53edb355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf1bd78a6d0caf9cd179662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4d5f8edcac017fbc2afc55578e189b03f1d66ca15351e77142a53a80ba41f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a908356f887065548817d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能接受……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a12b41fcf41b1713a34f38f8408503fde90d7d7edd3909b5fb093880786430",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
